      {
        "n": "RAW & FUNKY W/ HEKAI",
        "s": "2026-09-24T09:00:00+01:00",
        "e": "2026-09-24T10:00:00+01:00",
        "d": "This is the music that resonates with me. The frequencies making my body move. Hoping they will resonate inside you too, and make, whatever the distance, our entangled molecules dance together, to the same beat.\nThis is a pure selection of tracks I love dancing to, put together in a Rekordbox Playlist, and mixed without anything prepared at 11am (no sleep) the 22nd, date of submission. Trying to achieve raw, dumb, and fun at the same time ;)",
        "j": null,
        "u": "https://www.nts.live/api/v2/shows/dancing-2026/episodes/dancing-2026-raw-funky-w-hekai-24th-september-2026"
      },
      {
        "n": "Hazy Feels w/ Roger T",
        "s": "2026-09-24T10:00:00+01:00",
        "e": "2026-09-24T11:00:00+01:00",
        "d": "I created this mix to evoke the feeling of a hot sunny day, capturing that childhood sense of innocence and excitement from when I was a little boy at the beach with the seagulls overhead and the sea running over my feet\nFilled with hazy feels, euphoric moments and a few surprises but ultimately joyful fun",
        "j": null,
